  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Here, point of suspension has an acceleration. <math> <mrow> <mover accent=\"true\"> <mtext>a</mtext> <mo>&#8594;</mo> </mover> </mrow> </math> = g sin&nbsp; &theta; (down the plane). Further, <math> <mrow> <mover accent=\"true\"> <mtext>g</mtext> <mo>&#8594;</mo> </mover> </mrow> </math> can be resolved into two components g sin&nbsp; &theta; (along the plane) and g cos&nbsp; &theta; (perpendicular to plane).<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0014074_AnsExp1_1.jpg\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0014074_AnsExp1_2.jpg\" /><br /><math><mrow><msub><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>g</mtext> <mo>&#8594;</mo> </mover> </mrow> <mtext>eff</mtext> </msub> <mo>=</mo> <mover accent=\"true\"> <mtext>g</mtext> <mo>&#8594;</mo> </mover> <mo>-</mo> <mover accent=\"true\"> <mtext>a</mtext> <mo>&#8594;</mo> </mover> </mrow> </math><br /><br />= g cos&theta; (perpendicular to plane)<br /><br /><math><mrow><mtext>T</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mn>2</mn> <mtext>&#960;</mtext> <msqrt> <mfrac> <mrow> <mi></mi><mi></mi><mi></mi><mi>l</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo> </mrow> <mrow> <mo>|</mo> <msub> <mrow> <mover accent=\"true\"> <mtext>g</mtext> <mo>&#8594;</mo> </mover> </mrow> <mtext>eff</mtext> </msub> <mo>|</mo> </mrow> </mfrac> </msqrt> </mrow> </math><br /><br />&nbsp; &nbsp; <math>&#160;<mrow><mo>=</mo> <mn>2</mn> <mtext>&#960;</mtext> <msqrt> <mfrac> <mrow> <mi></mi><mi></mi><mi>l</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>g</mtext> <mtext>cos</mtext><mtext>&#952;</mtext> </mrow> </mfrac> </msqrt> </mrow> </math><br />&nbsp;",
